# api/

The `udex-api` crate containing protobuf-generated gRPC types, service definitions, and authorization logic for the Udex service. It has no I/O operations — all network concerns live in `udex-server` and `udex-cli`. The build script generates Rust code from three protobuf services: entry, index, and healthz.

## Dirs

- `src/` -- Core API types, authorization utilities, and generated protobuf code

## Files

- `build.rs` -- Protobuf compilation script; generates Rust types from .proto files and fixes google.protobuf doctests
- `Cargo.toml` -- Package manifest with dependencies (tonic, prost, thiserror)
- `README.md` -- API documentation including JWT claims format, permission scopes, and client usage examples
